---
import studies from '../data/powerhouse-book-studies.json';
const dates = ['Before 1600', '1677', '1830–1913', '1913', '1940', '1962'];
const stays = ['A night', 'A night', 'An hour', '5 min', '20 min', 'Hours'];
const stops = studies.pause.items.map((item,i)=>({...item,date:dates[i],stay:stays[i]}));
---
<section class="pause" aria-labelledby="pause-timeline-title" data-book-studies="pause">
  <header><h3 id="pause-timeline-title">Architecture of the pause</h3><p>Six spatial ideas, from the shared court to the waiting hall.</p></header>
  <ol class="pause__track">
    {stops.map((stop,i)=><li>
      <a class="phi__image-link pause__art" href={stop.src} target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label={`Open full-size diagram: ${stop.title}`}><img src={stop.src} alt={`${stop.title}: ${stop.caption}`} width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></a>
      <div class="pause__label"><b><small>{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</small>{stop.title}</b><span>{stop.date} · {stop.stay}</span><p>{stop.caption}</p></div>
    </li>)}
  </ol>
  <div class="pause__next"><b>NEXT · The Powerhouse</b><span>20 min–a night · An open court, a charging edge and rooms for the neighbourhood.</span></div>
  <p class="pause__note">AI-generated programme studies. Dates identify precedents; the drawings explain spatial relationships and are not measured reconstructions or a common scale.</p>
</section>
<style>
  .pause { width:100%;max-width:960px;min-width:0;display:grid;gap:16px;margin:24px auto; }
  header h3 { margin:0;font-size:20px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:500; }
  header p { margin:6px 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:var(--_tokens---color--muted); }
  .pause__track { list-style:none;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:22px 24px;margin:0;padding:0; }
  .pause__track > li { min-width:0; }
  .pause__art { display:block;width:100%;aspect-ratio:3 / 2;max-height:184px;background:#fff;cursor:zoom-in; }
  .pause__art img { display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain; }
  .pause__art:focus-visible { outline:2px solid currentColor;outline-offset:3px; }
  .pause__label { display:grid;gap:3px;padding-top:8px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.4; }
  .pause__label b { font-size:14px;font-weight:600; }
  .pause__label small { color:var(--_tokens---color--muted);font-size:11px;font-weight:400;margin-right:6px; }
  .pause__label span { color:var(--_tokens---color--muted);font-size:11px; }
  .pause__label p { margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.4; }
  .pause__next { display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px 16px;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid var(--_tokens---color--line-soft);font-size:12px;line-height:1.4; }
  .pause__next b { font-weight:600; }
  .pause__note { margin:0;font-size:10px;line-height:1.4;color:var(--_tokens---color--muted); }
  @media (max-width: 699.98px) { .pause__track { grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:18px 14px; }.pause__label b{font-size:13px} }
</style>
